    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Smears of small round cell tumours",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Alveolar rhabdomyosarcoma showing irregular nuclei, high N:C&nbsp;ratio, pale eccentric cytoplasm with fine glycogen vacuoles in some cells, and a &ldquo;tigroid&rdquo; finely granular background (Giemsa).",
    "source": "Helena Barroca",
    "copyright": "",
