    "diagnosis": "Classic Hodgkin lymphoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Scattered mononuclear Hodgkin cells with one or more large nucleoli and binucleated Reed&ndash;Sternberg cells with a macronucleolus in each nucleus, in a background of small lymphocytes and eosinophils (H&amp;E).",
