    "diagnosis": "Classic Hodgkin lymphoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Variably sized mononuclear Hodgkin cells with eccentric cytoplasm and more irregular nuclei and larger multinucleated cells with prominent nucleoli, in a background of small lymphocytes and eosinophils (Giemsa).",
    "source": "Helena Barroca",
