    "title": "<p>Most common lymphomas in paediatric age group: relevant age-related characteristics</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Helena Barroca",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"945\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 3.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.15pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Lymphoma</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 261.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"348\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Clinical presentation</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 377.25pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"503\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Predisposing/​risk factors</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">CHL</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 261.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"348\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>B&nbsp;symptoms: 20%</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Cervical, supraclavicular, inguinal lymph nodes</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Mediastinal disease: &lt;&nbsp;10&nbsp;years: 35%; adolescents/young adults: 75%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 377.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"503\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>EBV: Mixed cellularity histopathological subtype in children from low- and middle-income countries and males aged &lt;&nbsp;10&nbsp;years; consanguinity and among siblings of HL patients, monozygotic twins</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Lower socioeconomic status in children aged &lt;&nbsp;10&nbsp;years</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Other HL</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 261.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"348\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Rare under 3&nbsp;years of age</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 377.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"503\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Geographical variation</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Primary or as a second malignancy after chemotherapy or radiotherapy</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">In the setting of congenital/acquired immunodeficiency</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Posttransplant immunosuppression</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Immunosuppressive drugs</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">LBL</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 261.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"t